commits.body:
Clarifies the Keeping workers apart section in docs/AGENT_WORKFLOW.md so it matches the contributor coordination rules in AGENTS.md.

The previous wording said there was no reservation system to maintain, which could be misread as meaning issue #152 was unnecessary. The updated wording makes the intended distinction explicit:

contributor scopes must be reserved through issue #152;

active scopes must not overlap other contributors' reservations;

the 500 unfinished-function limit…
